mutation accept a lower cumulative count
detects TotalNeverFalls
only TwoDays
- Acceptable == /\ candidateTotal >= storedTotal
+ Acceptable == /\ TRUE

mutation accept a lower same-day count
detects SameDayTodayNeverFalls
only SameDay
-              /\ (candidateDay > storedDay \/ candidateToday >= storedToday)
+              /\ TRUE

mutation accept an older date
detects DateNeverRewinds
only TwoDays
-              /\ candidateDay >= storedDay
+              /\ TRUE

mutation overwrite the saved total after rejecting a query
detects RejectedKeepsLast
only Regressions
-          /\ storedTotal' = storedTotal
+          /\ storedTotal' = candidateTotal

mutation enter an invalid query phase
detects TypeOK
only SameDay
-  /\ phase' = "query"
+  /\ phase' = "invalid"
